00:08:27.676 --> 00:08:29.464
- So, as soon as I got Ned in a headlock,

00:08:29.464 --> 00:08:30.541
I'm like, you know what,

00:08:30.541 --> 00:08:32.418
Ned can do minimal damage from this point.

00:08:32.418 --> 00:08:33.051
- They're just hugging.

00:08:33.051 --> 00:08:34.765
- That is a really intense three minutes.

00:08:34.765 --> 00:08:37.015
It goes so fast when you see it on TV.

00:08:37.015 --> 00:08:38.309
(crowd cheers and screams)

00:08:38.309 --> 00:08:39.934
- [Jessica] Come on
fighters, up, up up up.

00:08:39.934 --> 00:08:42.969
Me and Chuck both can
agree on a winner here.

00:08:42.969 --> 00:08:44.728
Squirrel.
- [Eugene] Yay Squirrel. Nice.

00:08:44.728 --> 00:08:46.143
- Squirrel wins by the nut.

00:08:46.143 --> 00:08:47.939
We have Swagger versus Quiver.

00:08:47.939 --> 00:08:51.607
We are here today to
fight to the death. K?

00:08:51.607 --> 00:08:52.239
- What!?

00:08:52.239 --> 00:08:53.984
- I think I'll easily be
able to find the point

00:08:53.984 --> 00:08:55.327
where he's gonna destroy himself.

00:08:55.327 --> 00:08:56.694
- Fighter, are you ready?

00:08:56.694 --> 00:08:59.575
- No! Didn't come here to fight
Eugene, he's fucking crazy.

00:08:59.575 --> 00:09:00.481
- [Jessica] Fighter, are you ready?

00:09:00.481 --> 00:09:02.139
- Yeah!
- Let's get it on!

00:09:02.139 --> 00:09:03.142
(bell rings)
- [Zach] And for some reason,

00:09:03.142 --> 00:09:04.225
he wants to hurt me.

00:09:04.225 --> 00:09:04.844
(officials yelling)

00:09:04.844 --> 00:09:06.334
- I come from a striking background so,

00:09:06.334 --> 00:09:07.797
I'm gonna try to improve some of my

00:09:07.797 --> 00:09:09.373
wrestling and grappling techniques.

00:09:09.373 --> 00:09:10.585
- Oh, there you go, grab him.

00:09:10.585 --> 00:09:12.178
(body slams)
Nice job, there we go!

00:09:12.178 --> 00:09:13.466
- I landed some pretty solid punches

00:09:13.466 --> 00:09:15.135
on Eugene's beautiful, beautiful face.

00:09:15.135 --> 00:09:16.932
Don't get me wrong, he
beat the fuck out of me.

00:09:16.932 --> 00:09:17.982
- [Keith] It's hopeless, get up.

00:09:17.982 --> 00:09:21.405
- [Zach] (screams) He got me
to the ground, several times.

00:09:21.405 --> 00:09:23.049
- [Jessica] Throw. Yeah, there we go!

00:09:23.049 --> 00:09:25.391
- [Zach] But not like a minute
in, my body just quit on me.

00:09:25.391 --> 00:09:27.144
- [Ned] Oh my god, what is this?

00:09:27.144 --> 00:09:29.396
- It was kind of fun, until I got punched

00:09:29.396 --> 00:09:31.975
and knocked down and everything.

00:09:31.975 --> 00:09:33.254
No, it sucked. I hated it.

00:09:33.254 --> 00:09:35.077
(crowd counts down from three)
I never want to do this again.

00:09:35.077 --> 00:09:36.396
- [Chuck] Now kiss him like you mean it!

00:09:36.396 --> 00:09:37.907
- [Eugene] That was embarrassing for you.

00:09:37.907 --> 00:09:39.854
- We declare our winner, Swagger.

00:09:39.854 --> 00:09:41.169
(bell rings)

00:09:41.914 --> 00:09:43.412
- I honestly have been
really afraid of fighting,

00:09:43.412 --> 00:09:45.026
but in this environment, this is awesome,

00:09:45.026 --> 00:09:47.333
like this is a great way
to like train and workout.

00:09:47.333 --> 00:09:48.877
- I feel like I was able to link up

00:09:48.877 --> 00:09:50.047
everything we learned today.

00:09:50.047 --> 00:09:52.505
It felt a little savage,
but I feel like I got

00:09:52.505 --> 00:09:55.048
a greater appreciation
of all of the strategy

00:09:55.048 --> 00:09:56.008
that goes into it.

00:09:56.008 --> 00:09:58.280
- I'm exhausted, I'm dizzy.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.679
Pretty nauseous actually.

00:09:59.679 --> 00:10:01.092
Is this what a concussion feels like?

00:10:01.092 --> 00:10:02.563
- I think UFC has a new fan now,

00:10:02.563 --> 00:10:03.930
I'm definitely gonna start following it.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.727
- We're here and what are we doing?

00:10:05.727 --> 00:10:07.686
- We're going to fight night!

00:10:07.686 --> 00:10:09.772
- [Keith] At the Staples Center.

00:10:09.772 --> 00:10:11.906
It's time to watch people kill each other.

00:10:11.906 --> 00:10:13.272
Oh, we have to cross.

00:10:13.272 --> 00:10:16.983
(loud dance music)

00:10:20.251 --> 00:10:24.815
- [Eugene] Try Guys, at, UFC.
- [Ned] Fight night baby.

00:10:26.153 --> 00:10:27.736
Chea, chea, chea, chea, chea.
- [Eugene] What.

00:10:27.736 --> 00:10:29.120
- [Keith] We're all having a good time.

